## The doctrine in force

{{^reads.doctrine_local.bundles}}
**THE DOCTRINE IN FORCE IS NONE.** No bundle is installed. No cardinal binds this host through
this kit.

That is a complete and legal state, and `check` is green on it. This framework ships no doctrine
bundle of its own and will not supply a starter one: a default norm is an opinion installed by a
party that was never asked. What it ships is the carrier — the shape of a distributed cardinal,
the shape of an answer to one, and this page — so that a host which takes doctrine is answering a
publisher rather than filling in a blank somebody left for it.
